  "_doc": "Cloud Tasks > Inboxes > Notes: the declaration of the card-notes surface (a notebook / section / page / card hierarchy, shown OneNote-style: notebooks, coloured section tabs, a page list and a masonry of cards). Kotlin holds the behaviour only; every name, label, colour, breakpoint and seed here is data. Baked into the APK as an asset (app/build.gradle adds data/notes as an assets dir) and read by data/Notes.kt. The cards persist in the prefs file tasks_notes (fleet-config.json::stores.tasks_notes) under the key declared by `store`.",
